WEBVTT

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:43.180
Do Hirscher-san's presents
not make you happy, Triela?

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:48.450
He doesn't care what I like;
he always gets me the same thing.

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:03.800
Listen, Triela!

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:07.800
No shooting without my permission!

00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:16.710
Then why don't you increase
the level of my conditioning?

00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:34.230
Well, hold down the fort!

00:01:34.230 --> 00:01:35.720
Will do.

00:01:49.180 --> 00:01:53.640
Now, then. What shall I do today?

00:01:54.690 --> 00:02:02.430
Amid the difficulty of
sticking to that one feeling,

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:17.310
I want to protect you and fulfill
my promise to the only one for me

00:02:17.310 --> 00:02:24.750
In a world filled with doubt,
I still can't find the answer

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:31.960
Even so, I continue forward... Why?

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:42.400
If I can change this dream-like
reality with my own two hands,

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:49.970
amid the difficulty of
sticking to that one feeling,

00:02:49.970 --> 00:02:57.510
I want to protect the only one for me

00:02:57.510 --> 00:03:05.260
I swear on my beating heart I will
continue to run until I burn away

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:12.900
Amid the eternal love
I feel simply by living,

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:20.930
I want to fulfill my promise

00:03:33.220 --> 00:03:37.450
A Public Safety investigator
has disappeared in the north.

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:41.830
As such, I would like Section 2
members to go there and investigate.

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:43.530
Are you up for it?

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:46.560
Given that the chief of Section 2
gave his approval the other day,

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:48.570
there is nothing I can say.

00:03:48.570 --> 00:03:51.300
The Public Safety
official was last heard from

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:54.510
in a small town named Montalcino.

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:58.410
He'd been investigating the identity
of an assassin named Pinocchio,

00:03:58.410 --> 00:04:02.070
who works for the Padania...
the Five Republics Faction.

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:07.150
You'd best watch out
for the Padania yourself.

00:04:07.150 --> 00:04:10.050
I can go in your place, if you'd like.

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:12.860
After all, it'd be too much
for a Section 2 doll to handle.

00:04:12.860 --> 00:04:16.430
No, that's quite all right, Jeremiah.

00:04:16.430 --> 00:04:19.860
My Triela is exceptional at her work.

00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:34.110
If you won't increase her conditioning,

00:04:34.110 --> 00:04:37.880
then it's your
responsibility to train her right.

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:41.190
Though I'm no one to talk.

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:44.760
I won't give her conditioning
when she doesn't need it.

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:47.090
That's what's bothering me.

00:04:48.860 --> 00:04:51.590
Seems we both got stuck
with a job we're not good at.

00:04:57.130 --> 00:05:00.370
Good morning, Hirscher-san!

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:09.600
Good morning, Triela. Well, let's go.

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:16.950
"Simulacra"

00:05:50.890 --> 00:05:53.260
Montalcino...

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:56.850
It looks like a town right
in the middle of Tuscany.

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:03.200
It doesn't seem like I belong here...

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:05.300
Makes me uncomfortable.

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:08.370
Yeah, we usually never come
to the countryside like this.

00:06:08.370 --> 00:06:12.540
Are you sure about these
clothes? I'm going to stand out.

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:15.680
They can be useful sometimes.

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:19.820
For getting into high-class
restaurants, for example.

00:06:19.820 --> 00:06:20.810
Besides...

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:22.440
Besides?

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:26.150
They look good on you.

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:50.410
Seeing as this Public Safety
official's car is still in the parking lot,

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:53.010
does that mean he's still in town?

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:57.820
And who is this Pinocchio
person he was looking for?

00:06:57.820 --> 00:07:00.090
Good questions.

00:07:00.090 --> 00:07:03.360
Let's start by finding
the hotel Cohen was staying at.

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:09.760
Hirscher-san. Why are we
being sent to find someone?

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:16.510
I'm not sure. Our Section 2 isn't
the most respected in the agency,

00:07:16.510 --> 00:07:19.680
so this could be a conspiracy
that someone's cooked up.

00:07:19.680 --> 00:07:22.850
There's too much to be
paranoid about, though.

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:26.950
We're always surrounded
by enemies, aren't we?

00:07:26.950 --> 00:07:30.590
I'm not worried. I have
a reassuring ally, after all.

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:34.560
Uhh, please don't tell me you mean me...

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:37.030
Is that bad?

00:07:37.030 --> 00:07:40.630
I'll never betray you, Triela.

00:07:40.630 --> 00:07:42.390
You can count on that.

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:11.700
Nicolas Cambio...

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:13.500
Here we are.

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:16.630
I thought we were looking
for a man named Cohen?

00:08:16.630 --> 00:08:20.870
Cambio is the alias he uses.

00:08:20.870 --> 00:08:24.740
Say. I'd like to take a
peek inside this room...

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:29.370
Certainly, sir!

00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:37.590
You're rather good at that.

00:08:37.590 --> 00:08:39.190
That was kind of impressive.

00:08:39.190 --> 00:08:43.430
It's only natural. I was a
police detective at one point.

00:08:43.430 --> 00:08:46.560
This is my real ID, only "altered."

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:50.620
So I'm 99% a real policeman.

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:56.700
Compared to that, I'm completely fake.

00:09:23.970 --> 00:09:26.240
Triela.

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:28.970
Open this suitcase.

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:30.370
Yes, sir.

00:09:33.140 --> 00:09:35.280
You can break it if you have to.

00:09:35.280 --> 00:09:38.210
It's all right. I've practiced.

00:09:50.390 --> 00:09:53.020
It's an address or a phone number...

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:56.030
I'm going downstairs to check real quick.

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:57.330
Yes, sir.

00:10:08.610 --> 00:10:11.100
"The Adventures of Pinocchio..."

00:10:20.020 --> 00:10:26.230
Pinocchio was a puppet
born from magical firewood.

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:33.540
He wanted to repay his debt to
Mister Geppetto for making him,

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:39.600
but because his head was made of
wood too, he always caused trouble.

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:49.790
Eventually, an incident he causes
separates him from Geppetto...

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:54.050
so Pinocchio sets out on
an adventure to find him.

00:10:56.790 --> 00:11:01.130
After reuniting with the old
man at the end of his adventure,

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:07.070
Pinocchio is reborn as a boy
with the aid of a blue-haired fairy.

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:40.400
What a stupid story.

00:12:05.900 --> 00:12:07.730
Hello!

00:12:07.730 --> 00:12:09.130
Do you live here?

00:12:09.130 --> 00:12:14.370
Eh? No, I just live nearby...

00:12:14.370 --> 00:12:17.740
Do you need to see Pino for something?

00:12:18.980 --> 00:12:23.250
I came to see a person named
Massimo-san. Is this his house?

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:27.050
Massimo-san hasn't been here
for a long time. He lives in Milan.

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:31.660
So he's renting it to his relative Pino now.

00:12:31.660 --> 00:12:33.620
Oh, I see.

00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:38.530
- What's that?
- My mom made it.

00:12:38.530 --> 00:12:41.160
I thought I'd bring Pino some.

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:44.430
I see! It looks delicious!

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:46.870
Thanks! You really helped me out!

00:12:48.810 --> 00:12:52.100
I guess pretty girls
have it easy in life, too...

00:13:08.190 --> 00:13:13.530
It seems someone else is living in
that house. A relative or something.

00:13:13.530 --> 00:13:15.360
Pino, I believe she said.

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:25.180
A guy renting the second
home of a rich man in Milan...

00:13:25.180 --> 00:13:28.910
This is definitely the place the
Public Safety official was looking for.

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:32.480
I hope the microphone I
planted helps us learn something.

00:13:32.480 --> 00:13:35.750
Things are getting a bit
much for just the two of us.

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:39.050
It'll take an hour for help from
the Florence branch to arrive.

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:53.200
Pino?

00:14:27.270 --> 00:14:28.740
Freeze!

00:14:28.740 --> 00:14:30.640
Drop the gun!

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:31.910
Freeze!

00:14:31.910 --> 00:14:35.180
A kid?! Are you one of
those government assassins?!

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:38.110
I-I'm...

00:14:38.110 --> 00:14:41.640
Put the gun down! On the table!

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:50.560
- Who's this?
- No! Let go!

00:14:50.560 --> 00:14:52.000
I don't know.

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:55.300
Is she one of those
assassins you were talking about?

00:14:55.300 --> 00:14:57.030
Aurora!

00:15:02.610 --> 00:15:04.110
Pino!

00:15:04.110 --> 00:15:05.580
You know her?

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:09.410
Pino! Help! Pino!

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:13.780
I told you to stay away from me.

00:15:15.190 --> 00:15:19.290
Pino! Why?! Pino! Please!

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:22.460
I told you not to bother with me.

00:15:22.460 --> 00:15:26.500
This is bad. They've caught the girl.

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:29.930
Do you think the F.R.F. Is in that house?

00:15:29.930 --> 00:15:33.500
Triela! Get ready to bust inside!

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:37.770
Are you sure, Hirscher-san?!
Backup hasn't arrived yet!

00:15:37.770 --> 00:15:40.940
Plus, we don't know the
Public Safety official's status...

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:44.180
- or how many we're up against...
- Help! I won't say anything!

00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:47.340
Let me go home!

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:54.160
No, I can't ignore her!

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:58.500
Triela! Bust inside and help the girl!

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:00.190
Understood!

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:03.670
Pinocchio! Explain what's going on!

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:05.500
She's a kid from the neighborhood.

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:09.140
She kept hanging around me
and wouldn't leave me alone.

00:16:09.140 --> 00:16:10.710
What are you going to do?

00:16:10.710 --> 00:16:13.840
What do you mean? Kill her, of course.

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:15.940
She's seen your faces.

00:16:18.380 --> 00:16:22.080
Hold on! This isn't that big of a deal!

00:16:23.090 --> 00:16:25.490
It'll interfere with my old man's work.

00:16:25.490 --> 00:16:29.290
I told you, I choose who I kill!

00:16:41.340 --> 00:16:46.380
Fine. You really are nice...

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:52.280
Let's leave this town for now
and report to Cristiano later.

00:16:56.220 --> 00:16:58.420
Freeze, Padania!

00:16:58.420 --> 00:17:01.120
Drop your weapons
and lie down on the floor!

00:17:02.190 --> 00:17:05.200
It appears this one is a real assassin.

00:17:05.200 --> 00:17:07.100
It would seem so.

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:11.730
Now lie down on the floor!

00:17:20.110 --> 00:17:21.600
Why, you...

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:38.260
Franco! You go on ahead, too!

00:17:41.060 --> 00:17:42.330
Stop!

00:19:16.990 --> 00:19:20.700
I'm sorry. I'll let you go soon.

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:23.190
Freeze! Police!

00:19:31.740 --> 00:19:33.510
What do you want, policeman?

00:19:33.510 --> 00:19:35.570
I'll take the gun.

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:54.960
Franca!

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:57.260
- You alright?!
- Yes...

00:20:43.750 --> 00:20:47.380
Triela! Triela!

00:20:47.380 --> 00:20:50.890
Are you all right, Triela?!

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:52.650
Hirscher-san!

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:58.360
Don't move yet. It was probably a concussion.

00:20:58.360 --> 00:21:01.600
- Where's the girl?
- She's safe and sound.

00:21:01.600 --> 00:21:04.260
We let the local police take care of her.

00:21:05.640 --> 00:21:08.770
The Public Safety official's
body was in the wine cellar.

00:21:08.770 --> 00:21:12.300
I guess it was Pinocchio
who was staying here after all.

00:21:13.640 --> 00:21:16.010
And them?

00:21:16.010 --> 00:21:20.020
I'm sorry. They all got away.

00:21:20.020 --> 00:21:25.790
I let them escape, without
even giving them a scratch...

00:21:25.790 --> 00:21:29.760
You saved the little girl's life,
and we made it through alive, too.

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:31.750
There's nothing to regret.

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:44.440
We didn't know who we
were dealing with. That's all.

00:21:44.440 --> 00:21:46.140
And I was the one who decided to storm...

00:21:46.140 --> 00:21:51.140
I'm a cyborg! And I was
beaten with bare hands!

00:21:52.150 --> 00:22:00.680
Why I've sacrificed my life,
why I've taken these risks...

00:22:02.990 --> 00:22:05.090
T-This makes it all meaningless...

00:22:09.470 --> 00:22:11.670
Triela...

00:22:11.670 --> 00:22:14.270
Please don't touch me!

00:22:14.270 --> 00:22:19.170
Please let me be by myself for a while...

00:22:39.030 --> 00:22:41.460
Let's go to the vineyards in Frascati.

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:43.530
Considering what just happened,

00:22:43.530 --> 00:22:45.940
I'd prefer to head south, closer to Rome...

00:22:45.940 --> 00:22:51.500
I'll contact Cristiano
while I find us a rental car.

00:22:52.680 --> 00:22:55.910
Let me see your hand. It's swollen.

00:22:57.950 --> 00:23:02.220
That shotgun girl...
Was she a government assassin?

00:23:02.220 --> 00:23:05.190
I was going to finish her off...

00:23:05.190 --> 00:23:07.460
but I couldn't kill her.

00:23:07.460 --> 00:23:10.530
Forget about your pendant.

00:23:10.530 --> 00:23:14.620
As full of memories as it may be,
the object itself isn't what matters.

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:25.200
What's important is what's in your heart.

00:23:43.830 --> 00:23:58.640
A doll without a heart,
born from warm hands

00:23:58.640 --> 00:24:07.980
I neither smile nor talk

00:24:07.980 --> 00:24:16.060
I want you to hear about
these feelings someday,

00:24:16.060 --> 00:24:24.400
though they can't be put into words

00:24:24.400 --> 00:24:32.440
I'll summon all my strength

00:24:32.440 --> 00:24:45.290
to know what it means to live

00:25:01.870 --> 00:25:06.850
"Angelica's Return"
